  "solution": "Given equation: (63 ÷ 9 + 17) ÷ 11 = 15 – 195 ÷ 17 – 2.\n\nBODMAS Table: \n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/d50192f098c21078501d30eeafe1a8c64bc30dd9621c48caa8a39ffc60f68b64.png] \n\nLet's check each option one by one.\n\nOption 1) 11 and 15\n\nGiven: (63 ÷ 9 + 17) ÷ 11 = 15 – 195 ÷ 17 – 2\n\nAfter interchanging the numbers we get;\n\n⇒ (__**63 ÷ 9**__ + 17) ÷ 15 = 11 – __**195 ÷ 17**__ – 2\n\n⇒ (__**7 + 17**__) ÷ 15 = __**11 – 11.48 – 2**__\n\n⇒ __**24 ÷ 15**__ = –2.48\n\n⇒ 1.6 ≠ –2.48\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\n**Option 2) 17 and 15**\n\nGiven: (63 ÷ 9 + 17) ÷ 11 = 15 – 195 ÷ 17 – 2\n\nAfter interchanging the numbers we get;\n\n⇒ (__**63 ÷ 9**__ + 15) ÷ 11 = 17 – __**195 ÷ 15**__ – 2\n\n⇒ (__**7 + 15**__) ÷ 11 = __**17 – 13 – 2**__\n\n⇒ __**22 ÷ 11**__ = 2\n\n⇒ **2 = 2**\n\n**⇒ LHS = RHS**\n\nOption 3) 195 and 63\n\nGiven: (63 ÷ 9 + 17) ÷ 11 = 15 – 195 ÷ 17 – 2\n\nAfter interchanging the numbers we get;\n\n⇒ (__**195 ÷ 9**__ + 17) ÷ 11 = 15 – __**63 ÷ 17**__ – 2\n\n⇒ (__**21.67 + 17**__) ÷ 11 = __**15 – 3.7 – 2**__\n\n⇒ __**38.67 ÷ 11**__ = 9.3\n\n⇒ 3.52 ≠ 9.3\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nOption 4) 2 and 15\n\nGiven: (63 ÷ 9 + 17) ÷ 11 = 15 – 195 ÷ 17 – 2\n\nAfter interchanging the numbers we get;\n\n⇒ (__**63 ÷ 9**__ + 17) ÷ 11 = 2 – __**195 ÷ 17**__ – 15\n\n⇒ (__**7 + 17**__) ÷ 11 = __**2 – 11.48 – 15**__\n\n⇒ __**24 ÷ 11**__ = -24.48\n\n⇒ 2.18 ≠ -24.48\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nHence, the correct answer is \"Option 2\".",
